 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The well is deep and the sun is high",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have nothing to draw with, I ask you why",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who gave this water that you hold so tight",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Are you greater than the father of the light",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jacob gave us the well and drank from it himself",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With his sons and his livestock in the field",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone who drinks this water will be thirsty again",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But whoever drinks the water I give will never thirst again",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The water I give will become in them a spring",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Welling up to eternal life",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sir give me this water so I will not get thirsty",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And have to keep coming here to draw water from the earth",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You see the need in my hands and in my soul",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
